
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport"
        content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Talk to Vale</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      background: #151321;
      color: white;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,
                   "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 400px;
    }

    .avatar {
      width: 120px;
      height: 120px;
      margin: 0 auto 30px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg,
                                  #a78bfa, #ec4899);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 60px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 60px #a78bfa44;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    p {
      color: #c9c4d8;
      line-height: 1.6;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    button {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      margin-top: 35px;
      padding: 20px;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 40px;
      background: #a78bfa;
      color: #151321;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    button:disabled {
      opacity: 0.65;
    }

    .note {
      margin-top: 20px;
      font-size: 13px;
      opacity: 0.65;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="avatar">💜</div>

    <h1>Hello, I'm Vale!</h1>

    <p>
      I'm an AI assistant here on behalf
      of Claudiu.
    </p>

    <p>
      Fancy a little chat?
    </p>

    <button disabled>
      🎙️ Start talking
    </button>

    <p class="note">
      Voice conversation coming soon.
      Our first five-minute test is
      being prepared.
    </p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
